ivors must work together to complete objectives, rescue teammates, unlock the exit, and escape while being hunted by a powerful Killer.\n\nEvery match is different. Search for materials to craft items and use weapons or abilities to help you survive. Make risky choices to protect your team before they're killed off one by one...\n\n◉ SURVIVORS: Work together, complete objectives, rescue teammates, and escape.\n◉ KILLER: Use unique powers and abilities to hunt down and kill every Survivor before they escape.\n◉ PROGRESSION: Unlock new Survivors, Killers, cosmetics, upgrades, and rewards as you play.\n\n[CROSSOVER EVENT AT 13K LIKES]\n\n-This is an ongoing passion project worked on and maintained by a single developer. Feedback and bug reports are greatly appreciated!- ","path":"/game/6375883252-trepidation-new-code","slug":"6375883252-trepidation-new-code","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8b96d1d02f9dffac9631bd098caba23b844033449f4e66e088acf456bb54bf0c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dcba4069d781b0b7a97f98a9917ed6f3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":3498713,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-20T13:54:57.328Z","creator":{"name":"Oozyseus","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4375458071,"name":"Elemental Grind Game","desc":"I decided to remake an old game","path":"/game/4375458071-elemental-grind-game","slug":"4375458071-elemental-grind-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/006e6102ccd50b282bd4378e5e734eaabeeb3191c9ea4dbf74aad4467c90524b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5873f125a229ea4f86821af54377d330/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":27835148,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-18T22:52:22.828Z","creator":{"name":"rentabean","type":"User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":5082331079,"name":"[BACKROOMS] CULT OF THE CRYPTIDS ","desc":"","path":"/game/5082331079-backrooms-cult-of